 which made me slow down and hesitate since I wasn't exactly sure where I was entering the green and the visibility was bad. It would have been better to have a good sense of the distance I should go before entering the green, or at least know that I am entering earliy and then following the compass and feeling confident that I am still coming to the control.","size":8,"color":"#e11d48"},{"id":"0c405cd0-c47e-4696-b195-fddb4ca8cf8d","position":{"x":1339.9559707363055,"y":1425.6076840103456},"comment":"Felt like it took a while to get to the stream","size":8,"color":"#e11d48"},{"id":"b942291e-f57f-4591-8a56-91ae371e5b20","position":{"x":1459.4129807964714,"y":1416.7188554709467},"comment":"Felt like I was a bit closer to this green and open area than I actually was, just note to self to be careful when following lines in the terrain to be precise ","size":8,"color":"#e11d48"},{"id":"cae44578-15f8-443a-83b3-c3ec54ccb02f","position":{"x":838.8217051025655,"y":1125.2472203348757},"comment":"Was not exactly sure about my height here but I was pretty close to estimating my distnace from the green to the north so I felt confident enough to keep going on pressy much the same height. ","size":8,"color":"#e11d48"},{"id":"64140039-ef51-49e5-afc5-4c2a71ba77c6","position":{"x":734.0740212322817,"y":1159.3769907622213},"comment":"Got a bit enticed to climb up by another runner but saw my features below and took my control fine  since I knew I could be a few meters up or down","size":8,"color":"#e11d48"},{"id":"a3069fd8-5f9a-44c7-b3de-8e556faad6db","position":{"x":227.75151684033435,"y":916.2933391892477},"comment":"For some reason I thought the rock would be at a similar height to the previous control but it was noticeably lower which made me take and extra look at the map after crossing the yellow to understand where I was.","size":8,"color":"#e11d48"}],"rotation":0}